@startuml
' Gallery: while and repeat loops with labels and a backward action
start
:Open the connection;
repeat :Send a request;
  :Wait for the answer;
backward :Wait a second;
repeat while (Timed out?) is (yes) not (no)
while (More pages?) is (yes)
  :Read a page;
endwhile (no)
:Close the connection;
stop
@enduml
